--  ข้อมูลมอน/แผนที่สำหรับเซิร์ฟเวอร์ทอยดรอป-EXP — สร้างอัตโนมัติด้วย tools/gen_item_ids.js (ห้ามแก้มือ)
--  รันหลัง 20261012002000_event_chain.sql • รันซ้ำได้ (upsert)
-- ============================================================
on conflict (id) do update set lv = excluded.lv, exp = excluded.exp, jexp = excluded.jexp, zmin = excluded.zmin, zmax = excluded.zmax, boss = excluded.boss, wb = excluded.wb,
  elite = excluded.elite, respawn_ms = excluded.respawn_ms, drops = excluded.drops, chip = excluded.chip;

on conflict (map, mob) do update set n = excluded.n;

update public.save_verify_config set derived = derived || jsonb_build_object('gacha', '{"token":"valhalla_sigil","base":0.003,"fullGap":5,"zeroGap":20,"eliteMul":3,"mvp":1,"wb":3}'::jsonb, 'chip_drop', 0.002, 'chip_boss', 0.02), updated_at = now() where id = 1;
